wg-frag-go (0.5.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add public in-process Go and Unix-domain gRPC APIs for dynamically managing
    WGF interfaces and peers.
  * Add `wgf manager` for owning multiple interfaces in one process while
    keeping `wgf run` as the single-interface mode.
  * Add peer-only live updates and persistent-TUN runtime restarts, including
    `wgf quick reload` and systemd reload support.
  * Expose process-wide OpenMetrics consistently for single- and
    multi-interface operation, with counter continuity across runtime
    generations and same-identity recreation.
  * Validate generated Launchpad PPA source packages before signing and
    uploading them.

